          "doc": "An SLI written inline in its SLO, under spec.indicator: an element of its own contained in the SLO, marked inline (research R3; User Story 1, scenario 3).",
          "at": "/spec/indicator",
          "when": "type(entry) == map && parent != null && type(parent) == map && has(parent.apiVersion) && parent.apiVersion == 'openslo/v1' && has(parent.kind) && parent.kind == 'SLO'",
          "parent": {
